figuration Module (config)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Struct-tag based environment variable mapping keeps configuration type-safe without requiring external libraries like Viper, and supports isolated lookup for deterministic testing."}, {"id": "readme_application_lifecycle", "label": "Application Lifecycle Management", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Topological startup ordering and LIFO shutdown with automatic rollback on failure ensures deterministic resource management without per-project boilerplate."}, {"id": "readme_starthook", "label": "StartHook (Topological Dependency Ordering)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_stophook", "label": "StopHook (Reverse LIFO Graceful Shutdown)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_startup_rollback", "label": "Startup Failure Rollback", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_http_server", "label": "HTTP Server & REST API Toolkit (httpserver)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Built on Go's standard net/http.ServeMux (Go 1.22+) to eliminate third-party router dependencies, reducing the attack surface and keeping the framework zero-dependency."}, {"id": "readme_router_sandbox", "label": "Router Sandbox Pre-validation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_middleware_chain", "label": "Idiomatic Middleware Chain", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_database_integration", "label": "Database Integration (database/sql)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_injel_cli", "label": "Injel CLI", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_project_scaffolding", "label": "Project Scaffolding Engine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null}, {"id": "readme_zero_external_dependencies", "label": "Zero External Dependencies Principle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Core, DI, configuration, and HTTP modules rely exclusively on the Go standard library to avoid dependency bloat, license conflicts, and unexpected breaking changes from third-party packages."}, {"id": "readme_startup_only_reflection", "label": "Startup-Only Reflection Principle", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "rationale": "Reflection occurs once during application startup; no reflection on the HTTP request execution path, keeping per-request latency unaffected by the DI framework."}], "edges": [{"source": "readme_injel_framework", "target": "readme_ioc_di_engine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L127-L131", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "readme_injel_framework", "target": "readme_env_configuration", "relation": "referenc